\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve şerikleri - o şefaatini umdukları, teselli ve menfaat bekledikleri o putlar, o bîşuur tesavir ve temasil o kendilerine tapan müşriklere-şöyle demektedirler: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"189\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 188.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 44.3 44.3 51.0 51.0 57.7 73.6 80.3 87.0 93.7 93.7 100.6 100.6 116.3 116.3 125.3 125.3 132.0 132.0 138.7 138.7 159.0 165.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 57.7 80.3 93.7 165.7 172.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> siz bize ıbadet etmiyordunuz 29. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"265\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 265.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 37.6 44.3 44.3 51.0 57.7 75.0 81.7 88.6 95.3 95.3 102.0 117.7 124.6 124.6 133.6 140.3 140.3 148.6 168.7 168.7 175.6 175.6 175.6 182.3 189.7 196.6 196.6 212.3 223.6 223.6 230.3 242.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.6 51.0 57.7 81.7 88.6 102.0 148.6 230.3 242.3 249.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> zira sizinle bizim aramızda şahid olarak Allah, yeter ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"240\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 239.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 33.7 33.7 40.4 40.4 47.2 54.0 60.7 77.2 77.2 86.2 86.2 98.2 98.2 105.0 112.4 119.2 126.0 126.0 144.0 144.0 154.4 172.4 179.2 179.2 186.0 186.0 197.2 206.2 206.2 216.7 216.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 54.0 60.7 105.0 119.2 154.4 179.2 223.4\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> hakıkat budur: biz sizin ibadetinizden kat'iyyen gafil bulunuyorduk - ya'ni «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"146\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 146.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 18.7 18.7 27.0 47.3 47.3 54.0 54.0 65.3 85.6 85.6 85.6 96.0 96.0 116.3 127.6 127.6 134.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.0 65.3 134.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » olan Allah tealâ bilir ki sizin bize ıbadet ettiğinizden asla haberimiz yoktu, binaenaleyh siz taptınızsa bize değil, kendi hevanıza, hayalâtı bâtılenize tapmış, bize iftira etmişsiniz. Biz öyle bir şeyi asla kabul etmez reddederiz, bütün mes'ulliyet kendinize raci'dir. 30.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"79\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 79.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 33.0 33.0 40.4 47.2 54.0 54.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 47.2 63.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> İşte orada - o gün dehşetli makamda<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"218\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 218.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 33.0 39.8 46.6 57.8 73.6 73.6 80.3 96.0 113.3 113.3 120.0 135.8 135.8 135.8 146.3 146.3 166.6 173.3 181.6 181.6 188.3 188.3 195.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.0 39.8 46.6 57.8 80.3 96.0 120.0 195.0 201.8\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> her nefis, her can mukaddema yaptığını bulacak, ıhtibar edecek - iyi kötü amel veya terk o